[B1.3] DR: activation SOP exists (field note, A2.5).','[B1.2] Activation SOP is in use (lead assessor score 3). To keep this score under Methodology 5.2, file in the Document Vault: the activation SOP with its approval (CDRRMO Head or CDRRMC) and one activation record. Still to write: hazard-based triggers and the EOC posture under a State of Imminent Disaster (EOC Manual).

